# Agreement content immutability

**Stored agreement `content` is immutable once signed** (`signedAt` is set).

- Do not clear, rewrite, regenerate, or “fix the template” on signed contracts — including test fixtures and completed bookings.
- Signed text is a record of what the client agreed to. Changing it after the fact is not a judgement call.
- Unsigned content may be cleared or regenerated (e.g. empty `content` so `defaultAgreementContent` fills on next send) when explicitly requested.
- When changing `defaultAgreementContent`, only new/empty contracts pick it up; leave existing signed rows alone.
